{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a nuclear disaster, your bunker has become the last refuge. Every day is a struggle for resources, where every object is dangerous. Collect antenna parts to send a signal for salvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Beginning</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first 60 seconds determine your chances of survival. Grab everything valuable you can find - food, water, medicine, weapons. But remember: when the timer runs out, a nuclear strike will hit the surface. Those who are late will remain forever in radioactive ash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Bunker</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your bunker by creating new rooms and spaces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build generators (gas/solar/wind) and wire them to power your equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The bunker and its surroundings are your only safe island in this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exploration</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players leave the bunker by day to search for resources and antenna parts in procedurally generated locations (nuclear shelters, swamps, villages, towns).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each location features unique enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At nightfall, characters begin losing sanity - you must return to the bunker before dark.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your Goal</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect all antenna parts from defeated bosses to prepare for final evacuation.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2119830?t=1748311684","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119830/eb28afbba19