 swamps, villages, towns).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each location features unique enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At nightfall, characters begin losing sanity - you must return to the bunker before dark.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your Goal</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect all antenna parts from defeated bosses to prepare for final evacuation.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Platypus Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2119830/8e3564da094703b14d79d0e533cf237346c719c7/header.jpg?t=1748311684","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"MISERY uses the Unreal Engine 5. Unreal is a trademark or registered trademark of Epic Games, Inc. in the United States of America and elsewhere. Unreal Engine, Copyright 1998 - 2025, Epic Games, Inc. All rights reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257132361,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132361/movie480.mp4?t=1745875871","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132361/movie_max.mp4?t=1745875871"},"name":"Announce Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257132361/729a4821f99b2f2447220706afb37e68ceaf95ef/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745875871","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132361/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745875871","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.